  "body": "Per recommendation from kenchris@ via [TAG discussion](https://github.com/w3ctag/design-reviews/issues/469#issuecomment-633881658)\r\n\r\nRemove optional from `CookieStoreGetOptions`\r\n\r\n**Before**\r\n```\r\n Promise<CookieListItem?> get(optional CookieStoreGetOptions options = {});\r\n```\r\n**After**\r\n```\r\n Promise<CookieListItem?> get(CookieStoreGetOptions options);\r\n```\r\n",
